properties.APPL_DESC:
Site plan to facilitate the following changes on the subject lands:
-new curb cut and access at Regalcrest Court;
-modify existing landscaped area and install new landscaping;
-reconfigure parking area immediately adjacent to new curb cut;
-construction of new driveway; and
-provide new stop signs.

To sever and convey a parcel of land with an approximate lot frontage of 109 metres and an approximate lot area of 19,000 square metres (Part 25); 
and retain a parcel of land with an approximate lot frontage of 151 metres and an 
approximate lot area of 15,000 square metres (Parts 1 and 4); and establish servicing easements in favour of the severed lands (Parts 2 and 3).

To permit: a) an unenclosed stair to encroach 0.95 metres into the required interior side, whereas the by-law permits a maximum encroachment of 0.45 metres;
b) a second dwelling unit (basement suite), whereas the by-law permits no more than one
 semi-detached dwelling on one lot;
c) a minimum of 0 percent soft landscaping in the front yard, whereas the by-law requires a
minimum of 25 percent soft landscaping where the driveway width exceeds the width of
the garage door opening.
